Output banner.gif

Set Shell        "bash"
Set FontSize     22
Set Width        1200
Set Height       640
Set Padding      24
Set Margin       24
Set MarginFill   "#674EFF"      # Charm purple; swap for your brand color
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar     Colorful
Set Theme        "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed  35ms

Type "cd examples/demo" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "# cfggo: type-safe, hot-reloadable config for Go" Sleep 800ms Enter
Sleep 600ms
Type "sed -n '12,27p' main.go" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "# Access config with typed functions, not string lookups" Sleep 600ms Enter
Sleep 1.5s
